#. Placeholders: {app_title}, {code} (to quote to support), {support_email}.
msgid "unexpectedError"
msgstr ""
"An unexpected error occurred. If you see this message while you are using {app_title} at a workshop, please contact "
"your workshop technical support and show them this code: {code}. Otherwise please contact support at {support_email} "
"and quote this code: {code}."

